    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "legdbl0",
      "content": "Hand tools are manually operated tools used in workshops for operations such as cutting, shaping, tightening, gripping, measuring, and assembling materials. They do not require electricity or external power and are widely used in trades like fitter, electrician, mechanic, carpenter, welder, and plumber."
    },
